Project: Stack Data Structure
Description: LIFO stack, capacity 16, backed by i32 array
Operations: push, pop, peek, ssize
Test:
  Push values 1..10 onto stack
  Verify size == 10
  Verify peek == 10 (top of stack)
  Pop all 10 values, verify strictly decreasing (LIFO order)
  Verify size == 0 after drain
  Pop from empty stack -> expect -2
Expected exit code: 0
